WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.444
Your first week.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.348
Day one starts with an invitation from your leader.

3
00:00:07.348 --> 00:00:11.407
Choose a username, and a password of your own.

4
00:00:11.957 --> 00:00:15.990
Today opens with a short list for the week.

5
00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:20.044
Each step ticks itself off as you do it.

6
00:00:20.594 --> 00:00:22.664
First, protect your sign-in

7
00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:25.704
with a passkey or an authenticator app,

8
00:00:25.704 --> 00:00:28.801
so a password alone is never enough.

9
00:00:29.351 --> 00:00:30.800
Check your profile.

10
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:35.397
Your rank decides whether you build JEPES or FITREP input.

11
00:00:35.947 --> 00:00:38.199
Then log something you did.

12
00:00:38.199 --> 00:00:40.360
One sentence is enough.

13
00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:46.047
By Friday, open Team: who you work with,

14
00:00:46.047 --> 00:00:50.486
the command above you, and the goals you share.
